1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:06,000
An unnamed button is hard to identify
before you activate it.

2
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:12,000
Replay A11y compares announcements
and lets you review the issue card text.

3
00:00:13,500 --> 00:00:17,500
Before the fix, the button has no name.

4
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:26,500
[Before: TalkBack recording pending]

5
00:00:27,500 --> 00:00:31,500
After the fix, the name tells you
it changes the delivery address.

6
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:40,500
[After: TalkBack recording pending]

7
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:47,000
We prepare two excerpts to compare.

8
00:00:47,500 --> 00:00:54,000
Label them Before and After
in one UTF-8 text file, then select it.

9
00:00:55,000 --> 00:01:01,000
The app applies pattern masking
and shows both excerpts for comparison.

10
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:11,000
For extra masking, we switch
to a separate English synthetic sample.

11
00:01:11,500 --> 00:01:17,500
Rules mask contact details,
the amount and address, but not the name.

12
00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:22,500
We ask the on-device model
for another redaction.

13
00:01:29,000 --> 00:01:34,000
The app verified the response
came from the device.

14
00:01:34,500 --> 00:01:40,000
It suggests masking the fictional name
without changing either excerpt.

15
00:01:41,500 --> 00:01:47,000
We apply the suggestion
and review the exact card text.

16
00:01:47,500 --> 00:01:53,000
We approve making the card
on this device. Nothing is sent.

17
00:01:54,500 --> 00:02:00,500
In a separate cloud demo,
we select a fixed synthetic sample.

18
00:02:01,000 --> 00:02:06,500
We review the full outgoing prompt.
The local draft is not carried over.

19
00:02:08,000 --> 00:02:15,000
A person approves this prompt,
then presses Send as a separate step.

20
00:02:20,500 --> 00:02:25,500
The source label confirms
this response came from the cloud.

21
00:02:26,000 --> 00:02:31,500
Gemini selects one possible fix.
The comparison quotes stay fixed.

22
00:02:32,000 --> 00:02:37,000
The app shows the issue card
in English and Korean.

23
00:02:38,500 --> 00:02:46,000
Compare the excerpts and redact them.
A person reviews what goes in the card.
